I am working as a software Engineer. 


First Person:

I - First person - Uses "am" -> I am a software engineer

Second Person: 
You /We /They - Second Person in case of pointing to other person/multiple people - uses "are" -> They are part of my team

Third Person:

He /She / It - Thrid persons - uses "is" -> He is a vice president


Tenses:

Simple Present: Habits & routines

Formula: Subject + base verb (+s/es for he/she/it)
